## About the site

West Mauritius is an editorial guide to the west coast of Mauritius, published by [COMPANY NAME], [ADDRESS].

## Information, not advice

We take care to keep information accurate, but opening hours, prices and other details change. Check with the business before you go. Our articles about buying property are general information, not legal, tax or financial advice; speak to a qualified professional before you decide.

## Featured places and partner links

Places marked "Featured" may be paid placements. Some links to bookings or partners are affiliate links: we may earn a commission if you book, at no extra cost to you. They are marked as partner links. Payment never buys a review.

## Property enquiries

When you send a property enquiry, we pass your details, with your consent, to developers and estate agents. We are not a party to any agreement you make with them and are not responsible for their offers or services.

## Content and use

The texts, photos and design of this site are protected. You may share links freely; please ask before reusing content.

## Liability

To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for decisions made on the basis of information on this site or on sites we link to.

